#5600
Inside Naz'ol~
   Thick reddish smoke blurs your vision, burning your eyes until they
water.  You can see nothing through it except what lies at your feet:
corpses, and the more you look, the more you see, mangled worse than the
leavings of a wolf pack.  Something very cruel and utterly without
conscience has torn this place apart.  The smoke drifts north into the
town, and the great gate lies to the south.  A trapdoor is set into the
cobbles here.
~
