#5601
Grand entrance to Naz'ol~
   You stand before a massive gate carved from the face of an enormous
slab of reddish marble, its surface worked with images of a proud and
peaceful town.  A foul stench seeps from the other side: the familiar
smell of decay and charred flesh.  As the smoke from within reaches you,
it almost makes you retch at the images it forms in your mind of what
could be waiting beyond.  The forest lies to the south.
~
