Central Square~
   You are standing in the once great square where people from all over
came to browse the shops and drink in the taverns.  Now the awnings are
torn and burned, the shop windows smashed, and a small fountain still
flows in the center as if nothing had happened.  Elijah Avenue leads
north and south, and Euc'lid Avenue east and west.
