Naz'ol's hidden Armory~
   This cramped hiding place behind a wall of crates was once the back
room of an armory.  Racks of weapons and pieces of armor have been
dragged in here and stacked out of sight, and a single candle burns low
on an upturned barrel.  A gap among the crates leads south to the
street.
