the blackest of agate material. There is a large table in the center of the
room. On it lies a globe of the world of The Dominion. It has all sides of
the world in vivid detail. Showing castles, towns, and forests perfectly.  
The western wall seems different than the others in that it is opaque in
color, and gives off an almost unnatural light. There is an inscription
on the wall.
